#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:39
#: 17669a3c40f5420daee06f8624acd7e5
msgid "If using CAN1, set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 10 (Scripting), :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver)"
